{"id":72137,"date":"2026-10-31T22:10:01","date_gmt":"2026-10-31T22:10:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72137"},"modified":"2026-10-31T23:11:31","modified_gmt":"2026-10-31T22:11:31","slug":"sao-silvestre-golega","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-golega\/","title":{"rendered":"12\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre da Goleg\u00e3 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">12\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre da Goleg\u00e3 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>12\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre da Goleg\u00e3 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na noite de sexta-feira, <strong>18 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partidas e chegadas junto ao emblem\u00e1tico <strong>P\u00f3rtico de Entrada da Vila da Goleg\u00e3<\/strong>, na <strong>Rua Diogo Boitacas<\/strong>, concelho da <strong>Goleg\u00e3<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal da Goleg\u00e3<\/strong> atrav\u00e9s da sua Subunidade Org\u00e2nica de Desporto, a cl\u00e1ssica ribatejana re\u00fane a corrida principal de <strong>10 km<\/strong> (com partida \u00e0s <strong>21:00<\/strong>) e a <strong>9\u00aa Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (com in\u00edcio \u00e0s <strong>21:15<\/strong>, ap\u00f3s a passagem dos primeiros atletas).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos de <strong>10 000 metros<\/strong> e <strong>5 000 metros<\/strong> desenrolam-se nas art\u00e9rias urbanas e planas da Capital do Cavalo, devidamente sinalizadas e acompanhadas pelas for\u00e7as de seguran\u00e7a, com um tempo limite global de <strong>1 hora e 30 minutos<\/strong>. A prova competitiva disp\u00f5e de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios oficiais da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (Juniores a Veteranos M70+\/F65+) e abastecimento l\u00edquido aos 5 km, culminando com abastecimento de \u00e1gua e fruta na meta.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Limitada a <strong>1000 participantes<\/strong> (800 vagas na corrida e 200 na caminhada), a prova distribui um aliciante quadro de pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos cinco primeiros da geral masculina e feminina (<strong>400 \u20ac<\/strong>, <strong>250 \u20ac<\/strong>, <strong>100 \u20ac<\/strong>, <strong>75 \u20ac<\/strong> e <strong>50 \u20ac<\/strong>), um pr\u00e9mio de <strong>200 \u20ac<\/strong> para a equipa com mais atletas finalistas e distin\u00e7\u00f5es especiais para atletas e clubes residentes no concelho. Todos os inscritos t\u00eam direito a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (tamanhos S a XL), dorsal, seguro e banhos nas <strong>Piscinas Municipais da Goleg\u00e3<\/strong>. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">18 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Goleg\u00e3, Santar\u00e9m<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-si